WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.145
Know what you are studying. Make time for
it.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:10.482
Name your subjects and give each one a
colour. Your plan, sessions, and statistics

00:00:10.482 --> 00:00:11.258
stay connected.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:18.463
Set a weekly goal in Command Center. Spread
the hours across your week, beside the

00:00:18.463 --> 00:00:19.626
time already studied.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.595
Choose Pomodoro, a custom countdown, or a
stopwatch. Breaks are tracked

00:00:26.595 --> 00:00:27.054
separately.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.700
Choose a subject and start. Pause, log a
distraction, then resume the same

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.097
session.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:43.993
Rate your focus and note what you worked on.
Save the session, and the time counts

00:00:43.993 --> 00:00:45.014
toward your goals.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:52.905
Find past sessions by subject or date, with
notes, ratings, and distractions.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:00.979
See where your time went, by subject,
weekday, and hour. Change the range to

00:01:00.979 --> 00:01:02.142
compare another period.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:09.723
Try a daily study target. Move the slider to
see whether your pace meets the

00:01:09.723 --> 00:01:10.758
week's remaining goals.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.662
See your study pattern, day by day.

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:19.194
Try Study Flow.
